{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36471","headline":"冬日寄献庾员外 · 罗邺","name":"冬日寄献庾员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾谒仙宫最上仙，西风许醉桂花前。\n争欢酒蚁浮金爵，从听歌尘扑翠蝉。\n秋霁卷帘凝锦席，夜阑吹笛称江天。\n却思紫陌觥筹地，兔缺乌沈欲半年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36471.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36471","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}